<Layout title="Terence">
  <h1>Terence</h1>
  <p class="lede">Staff software engineer at <a href="https://www.offchainlabs.com/">Offchain Labs</a>.</p>

  <p>
    I've worked on Ethereum's consensus layer since 2018, mostly on
    <a href="https://github.com/OffchainLabs/prysm">Prysm</a>. I've also worked on
    some EIPs, like <a href="https://eips.ethereum.org/EIPS/eip-7732">EIP-7732</a>
    (ePBS) and <a href="https://eips.ethereum.org/EIPS/eip-7805">EIP-7805</a> (FOCIL).
    Most of my work lives on <a href="https://github.com/terencechain">GitHub</a>,
    and I share notes on <a href="https://ethresear.ch/u/terence">ethresear.ch</a>.
  </p>

</Layout>
